  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry Education2005-09 - Monitoring Education Bolivia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ministry Education2005-09</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xE5;ls&#xE4;ttning med Sidas utbildningssamarbete med Bolivia &#xE4;r att fr&#xE4;mja deltagandet av fattiga i prim&#xE4;r och sekund&#xE4;r undervisning. St&#xF6;det baseras p&#xE5; ministeriets fler&#xE5;riga plan ,POMA 2004-2010. Svenska st&#xF6;det harmoniseras i basketfund med DK och NL.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overarching objective of Sida&apos;s education co-operation with Bolivia is to promote the participation of the poor in both primary and secondary education. The support is based on the Multi-Annual Operative Plan, POMA, of the Ministry of Education, which establishes the framework for the country&apos;s educational goals. Swedish support is harmonised in the form of pool funding arrangements with DK and Holan</narrative>
  </description>
